{{if .reviewerform.treatment_certificate_id}}
### ✅ Treatment Certificate Issued

The NPQS Treatment Division has completed the treatment and issued a certificate.

* **Treatment Certificate Number**: `{{.reviewerform.treatment_certificate_id}}`
* **Treatment Outcome**: {{if eq .reviewerform.treatment_outcome "completed"}}🟢 Completed Successfully{{else}}🔴 Failed / Incomplete{{end}}
{{if .reviewerform.issue_comments}}* **Treatment Notes**: {{.reviewerform.issue_comments}}{{end}}
{{if .commodities}}
**Items Covered By This Certificate:**
{{range .commodities}}* 🏷️ **{{.commodity_common_name}}** (`{{.id}}`)
{{end}}
{{end}}
If any of these items required supervised treatment, a supervision report will follow before you're asked to upload certificates; otherwise you'll be asked to upload the treatment certificate documents directly.
{{else}}
### ⏳ Treatment Certificate Being Issued

The NPQS Treatment Division is completing the treatment and preparing the treatment certificate.

* **Reference Number**: `{{.reference_number}}`
* **Treatment Provider**: NPQS Treatment Division
{{if .commodities}}
**Items Under Treatment:**
{{range .commodities}}* 🏷️ **{{.commodity_common_name}}** (`{{.id}}`)
{{end}}
{{end}}

You will be notified once the treatment certificate has been issued.
{{end}}
